      "message": "Merge origin/main into issue/2014-tool-property-grid-v2\n\nTwo clashes with the plasma cut-data recipe PR (#2596) and the tool\npreview wordings on main:\n\n- tool_cutting_rows: both sides wrapped the cutting block in chrome. The\n  plasma PR added a CollapsingHeader; this branch's property grid already\n  opens the block in its \"Cutting data\" group. One collapsible stays -\n  the grid's - and the plasma PR's rules stay with it: a plasma recipe\n  does not fill a material slot (!r.is_recipe()), and the six-column mill\n  table scrolls across so it never widens the settings column.\n- tests/tool_holder_reference: keep this branch's tab-click pin and\n  main's \"In use: library holder ...\" wording.\n\nRefs #2014",
